            "description": "",
            "summary": "Roth MKM analyst Suji Desilva lowered the firm\u2019s price target on Arbe Robotics (ARBE) to $3 from $5 and keeps a Buy rating on the shares. Reflecting delayed automotive platform decisions, Arbe guided to a muted 2025 revenue outlook with the opportunity to ramp late in the year in some non-auto programs, the firm says. The company guided for a similar EBITDA loss for 2025 on a year-over-year basis. With the recent funding, Roth believes the company is funded to execute its operating plan. Publish",
